          {
            "id": "p20-q7-e",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "e",
            "prompt": "$\\displaystyle\\int_1^4(4x+5)\\,dx$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$45$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\int_1^4(4x+5)\\,dx&=[2x^2+5x]_1^4\\\\&=(32+20)-(2+5)\\\\&=45\\end{aligned}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 29
          },
          {
            "id": "p20-q7-f",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "f",
            "prompt": "$\\displaystyle\\int_1^4 4x\\,dx$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$30$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\int_1^4 4x\\,dx&=[2x^2]_1^4\\\\&=32-2\\\\&=30\\end{aligned}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 24
          },
          {
            "id": "p20-q7-g",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "g",
            "prompt": "$\\displaystyle\\int_1^4 5\\,dx$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$15$. An integral of a sum is the sum of the integrals: $45=30+15$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\int_1^4 5\\,dx&=[5x]_1^4\\\\&=20-5\\\\&=15\\end{aligned}$$\nAn integral of a sum is the sum of the integrals. The value in e equals the sum of the values in f and g: $45=30+15$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 35
          }
        ]
